etly in the corridor.<span class=\"q\" data-i=\"3\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">5. I keep my desk tidy.<span class=\"q\" data-i=\"4\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">6. I throw rubbish on the floor.<span class=\"q\" data-i=\"5\"></span></div>","items":[{"kind":"choice","options":["responsible","not responsible"],"answer":0},{"kind":"choice","options":["responsible","not responsible"],"answer":1},{"kind":"choice","options":["responsible","not responsible"],"answer":1},{"kind":"choice","options":["responsible","not responsible"],"answer":0},{"kind":"choice","options":["responsible","not responsible"],"answer":0},{"kind":"choice","options":["responsible","not responsible"],"answer":1}]},{"title":"Complete the words","instr":"Write the missing letters.","html":"<div class=\"cols2\"><div class=\"row\">1. <b style=\"letter-spacing:.6mm;font-family:Carlito\">o _ e - _ h i r _</b> <span class=\"tr\" style=\"font-style:normal\">(üçte bir)</span> <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"0\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">2. <b style=\"letter-spacing:.6mm;font-family:Carlito\">i _ _ t _ u m e _ t</b> <span class=\"tr\" style=\"font-style:normal\">(çalgı)</span> <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"1\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">3. <b style=\"letter-spacing:.6mm;font-family:Carlito\">n _ _ e r</b> <span class=\"tr\" style=\"font-style:normal\">(asla)</span> <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"2\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">4. <b style=\"letter-spacing:.6mm;font-family:Carlito\">u _ u a _ _ y</b> <span class=\"tr\" style=\"font-style:normal\">(genellikle)</span> <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"3\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">5. <b style=\"letter-spacing:.6mm;font-family:Carlito\">e _ _ i _ o n m e _ _</b> <span class=\"tr\" style=\"font-style:normal\">(çevre)</span> <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"4\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">6. <b style=\"letter-spacing:.6mm;font-family:Carlito\">r e s p _ n _ i _ _ _ _ t y</b> <span class=\"tr\" style=\"font-style:normal\">(sorumluluk)</span> <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"5\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">7. <b style=\"letter-spacing:.6mm;font-family:Carlito\">q _ i _ _ l y</b> <span class=\"tr\" style=\"font-style:normal\">(sessizce)</span> <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"6\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">8. <b style=\"letter-spacing:.6mm;font-family:Carlito\">f o _ _ o w</b> <span class=\"tr\" style=\"font-style:normal\">(uymak)</span> <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"7\"></span></div></div>","items":[{"kind":"text","answer":"one-third"},{"kind":"text","answer":"instrument"},{"kind":"text","answer":"never"},{"kind":"text","answer":"usually"},{"kind":"text","answer":"environment"},{"kind":"text","answer":"responsibility"},{"kind":"text","answer":"quietly"},{"kind":"text","answer":"follow"}]},{"title":"Match the opposites","instr":"Write the correct letter.","html":"<div class=\"cols2\"><div><div class=\"row\">1. <b>always</b> ↔<span class=\"q\" data-i=\"0\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">2. <b>close</b> ↔<span class=\"q\" data-i=\"1\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">3. <b>responsible</b> ↔<span class=\"q\" data-i=\"2\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">4. <b>loudly</b> ↔<span class=\"q\" data-i=\"3\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">5. <b>early</b> ↔<span class=\"q\" data-i=\"4\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">6. <b>true</b> ↔<span class=\"q\" data-i=\"5\"></span></div></div><div><div class=\"row\">a) late</div><div class=\"row\">b) irresponsible</div><div class=\"row\">c) never</div><div class=\"row\">d) quietly</div><div class=\"row\">e) far</div><div class=\"row\">f) false</div></div></div>","items":[{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e","f"],"answer":"c"},{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e","f"],"answer":"e"},{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e","f"],"answer":"b"},{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e","f"],"answer":"d"},{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e","f"],"answer":"a"},{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e","f"],"answer":"f"}]},{"title":"What is the responsibility?","instr":"Match.","html":"<div class=\"cols2\"><div><div class=\"row\">1. I use a cloth on the board. <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"0\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">2. I give water to the flowers. <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"1\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">3. I hold the flag in the ceremony. <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"2\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">4. I give the books to my classmates. <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"3\"></span></div><div class=\"row\">5. I talk to the audience with a microphone. <span class=\"q\" data-i=\"4\"></span></div></div><div><div class=\"row\">a) <b>carry the flag</b></div><div class=\"row\">b) <b>clean the board</b></div><div class=\"row\">c) <b>hand out the books</b></div><div class=\"row\">d) <b>present the programme</b></div><div class=\"row\">e) <b>water the plants</b></div></div></div>","items":[{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e"],"answer":"b"},{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e"],"answer":"e"},{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e"],"answer":"a"},{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e"],"answer":"c"},{"kind":"select","options":["a","b","c","d","e"],"answer":"d"}]}],"vocab":[["walk","yürümek"],["close","yakın"],["on foot","yürüyerek"],["responsible","sorumlu"],["follow","uymak"],["quietly","sessizce"],["responsibility","sorumluluk"],["environment","çevre"],["usually","genellikle"],["never","asla"],["instrument","çalgı"],["one-third","üçte bir"]],"learn":["transport","rule"]}}